@startuml UC06_State
!theme plain

title UC06 - Conversation State

[*] --> Active : created

state Active {
  [*] --> HasUnread : new message
  HasUnread --> Read : user opens
  Read --> HasUnread : new message

  [*] --> Typing : other user typing
  Typing --> [*] : timeout
}

Active --> Archived : user archives
Active --> Deleted : user deletes

Archived --> Active : user unarchives

note right of Deleted
  Retained for evidence
  or user deletion cleanup
end note

@enduml